    "en": {
      "trackName": "Offline Games for Watch!",
      "description": "No Wi-Fi needed! Offline games for both phone and watch — fun anytime, anywhere!\nEnjoy offline: relax on your phone or kill time on your watch, instantly dive into a world of fun — watch features + casual puzzle games, ready to play!\n\nAdorable Capybara series:\n\n* **Dash**: Tap to let Capybara swim through the deep sea, dodge obstacles, and have a blast!\n* **Bridge**: Hold to build a temporary bridge and safely cross to the next land~\n* **Parkour**: Tap to jump, avoid obstacles, dash forward!\n* **Maze**: Swipe to guide Capybara through the maze and enjoy a sense of achievement!\n\nClassic games endlessly fun:\n\n* Animal Match, Sand Removal, Merge Elephant, Brick Breaker… infinite levels, increasingly addictive!\n\nNew popular games keep coming: 2048, Tic-Tac-Toe, Number Sliding Puzzle, Gomoku, Wooden Tap, Tetris, Spider Solitaire, Pac-Man… optimized for phone & watch, smooth on big screen or wrist tap.\n\nSeamless watch-game integration, play anytime, game library continuously updated with new themes, levels, and games — every launch brings new surprises! Commute, queue, or free time, fun never stops!\n—————————————————————————————\nOffline Games member automatic renewal subscription instructions\n- Subscription period: 1 month/1 year\n- Payment: After the user confirms the purchase and makes the payment, it will be credited to the iTunes account\n- Renew subscription: Apple's iTunes account will be deducted within 24 hours before expiration. After the deduction is successful, the subscription period will be extended by one subscription period.\n- Cancel subscription: To avoid auto-renew, please cancel at least 24 hours before end of current subscription period\nTerms of Service: https://glendgame.github.io/Box/terms.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://glendgame.github.io/Box/privacy.html",
